  "chitchat": [],
  "description": "Bram keeps the Reach's lights on with scavenged parts, bad language, and a soldering iron that's never quite cool. Wiry and singed at the cuffs, he watches the load board the way other men watch a door — because out here, dark means dead. He'll fix anything for the right favour and trusts machines a great deal more than people.",
